      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "COWBOY'S RODEO (1) has a superb record at this trip, unbeaten so far from four starts. Hit the frame latest (30.73) when third at Wanganui in a Class 2. With a clean break looks hard to beat. PANAMA KING (2) was strong over this course and distance last time despite filling the minors, finishing 2 lengths behind Affiliated in 16.76 and recording a new PB here. This tougher but expected to be in the finish. MAKE 'EM RAIN (7) had a tricky draw last time and although midfield in fourth wasn't far away finishing 5 lengths from the winner (17.06). Great chance to atone. REDBACK JACK (3) can improve on an unplaced run here last time out.",
